s=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384250/extras/4363e0c4db61e2d93ecbd62565cbe782.avif?t=1746014336\" data-has-big width=800 height=533 /></span></p>",
